#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:5
msgid "Edit element properties"
msgstr "编辑元素属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:8
msgid "Edit element properties from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏编辑元素属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:10
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit element properties** menu item to display the element "
"properties PopUp window."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > 编辑元素属性** 菜单项以显示元素属性 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Edit Menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:17
msgid ""
"Select the `element family`_, the base type from the `element`_, at **Type**"
" tab."
msgstr ""
"在 **Type** 标签中选择 `元素家族 <element family_>`_，从 `元件 <element_>`_ 中选择基准类型 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:22
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element properties **Type** tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素属性 **Type** 标签"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:24
msgid "For `simple`_, `master`_ or `terminal block`_ elements:"
msgstr ""
"`简单 <simple_>`_、`master <master_>`_ 或 `terminal 块 <terminal block_>`_ 元素："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:26
msgid "Go to **Information** tab."
msgstr "转到 **信息** 标签 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:31
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element properties Information tab"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech元素属性信息标签"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:33
msgid "Fill each predefined field with the desired information."
msgstr "以想要的信息填充每个预定义的字段。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:34
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:38
msgid ""
"Press the button **OK** to accept and close the element properties PopUp "
"window."
msgstr "按下按钮 **OK** 接受并关闭元素属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:36
msgid "For  `slave`_ or `reference folio`_ elements:"
msgstr "`奴隶 <slave_>`_ 或 `参考框 <reference folio_>`_ 元素："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:42
msgid "Edit element properties from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏中编辑元素属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:44
msgid ""
"Press the icon |element-edit| from `toolbar`_ to display the element "
"properties PopUp window."
msgstr "按下图标 |element-edit| 从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 以显示元素属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:47
msgid "element-edit"
msgstr "元素编辑器"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:45
msgid ""
"Follow same procedure defined at the previous section starting from step 2."
msgstr "从步骤2开始，遵循上一节界定的相同程序。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_prop.rst:51
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Element**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 元素** 显示。"
